[[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6718503591","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1204#issuecomment-6718503591","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1204","id":6718503591,"node_id":"IC_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABkHQ6pw","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-11-08T07:00:43Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T07:00:43Z","body":"For clarified rumen fluid, the evidence supports withdrawing the cow-only exact MICRO:0000520 identity. Preserve the authentic record as an explicitly species-unspecified, variable processed-fluid local material, retaining separate source preparation descriptions. This scope does not assert equivalence of species, protocols or batch compositions. DSMZ sources permit cow or sheep; the cited JCM preparations do not specify species. MICRO:0001898 is specifically the DSMZ1310 preparation and cannot identify the generic/JCM owner. Supersede the W02 exact-520 support explicitly; retain original history as history.\n\nThe three incoming components in Casitone_Yeast_Extract_Rumen_Fluid, PY-glucose-rumen_Fluid and PYG_Rumen_Fluid require a distinct correction. Prior #204 comments already warn that their source labels say only rumen fluid. Redirecting their IDs to a local **clarified** owner keeps the unsupported processing assertion. The bounded correction is literal `component_name: rumen fluid`, `reference_scope: UNMAPPED`, no unsupported component_id, and preserved source-specific uncertainty/history. A generic UBERON grounding would require separate evidence review; it is not implicitly approved. This conclusion does not settle the separate sludge-fluid scope.\n\nSources: [MicrO0000520](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/api/ontologies/micro/terms?obo_id=MICRO:0000520), [MicrO0001898](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/api/ontologies/micro/terms?obo_id=MICRO:0001898), [DSMZ161](https://mediadive.dsmz.de/rest/medium/161), [DSMZ212](https://mediadive.dsmz.de/rest/medium/212), [JCM266](https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=266), [prior #204 conclusion](https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/204#issuecomment-5208800239).\n\nIndependent full-owner scope review is recorded in `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/existing-owner-scope-decisions-v1/`; decisions SHA256 `150af7315aa6688d4bc9adb3e2a27d0a0835ec8f8ac33d65b8951712b0382d81`, manifest `c664e35067692c0aa46c4570ec688ffba9281e692337cfa5de1e4f014dc2ce54`. The coordinator rehashed all 89 manifest members. This is a sourced conclusion for candidate preparation; final exact candidate bytes still require native validation and independent review. No maintained records or approvals have changed.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/comments/6718503591/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]]